.SS "Draw3d extension (optional)"
These letters are ignored by older clients (they never send them).
Servers without the extension reject them with a write error, which
clients use as a capability probe.
Float fields are IEEE754 binary32 in little-endian byte order
(same endianness as other
.B draw
integers).
Matrices are 4×4 row-major, matching Limbo
.IR draw3d (2)
.BR Matrix
layout
.RI ( m[row][col] ).
.HP
.B 3
.br
